		{
			dependencies: ["3061B917B5DC581C"]
			description: [
				"是时候建造真正的&c熔炉&r了。"
				""
				"大小不限，最大为 &n16x16x64&r，但必须是矩形。"
				""
				"基本的&c标准熔炉&r通常建在地面，底座为&n3x3&r。"
				""
				"而且你不需要把角落填满！"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"To make the &6smeltery,&r have a &esmeltery controller&r and &cfuel tank&r or &cheater&r in the &0seared brick wall&r, make sure to have a &abrick floor&r to. Then you need &cseared drain&r &nwithin the wall&r attached to &afaucets&r on the &noutside&r for the &bliquid&r to flow out on to a &etable&r or &6basin&r beneath the &afaucet.&r, then just click on it"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6熔炉&r用于制作&6铸件&r、&b金属工具&r，并用于储存&e熔融金属&r。在菜单的&l左侧&r放置要熔炼的&a矿石&r，&n中间&r是&b当前内部&r的内容，而&n右侧&r是放置&c燃料&r的地方。"
				""
				"If you have &emultiple different metals&r inside it and want a &bspecific one&r just &lclick&r it to move it to the &abottom,&r this machine &cpours out metal&r &ebottom to top&r. Though sometimes you could accidently make a&a alloy or mix&r of &etwo metals&r by having them both in the &csmeltery&r at the same time."
			]
